{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2022-07-21 08:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT COMMITS TO SET SCIENCE-BASED TARGETS FOR GHG EMISSIONS REDUCTION', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL. , JULY 21, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMMITTED TO SETTING SCIENCE-BASED TARGETS TO REDUCE GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS IN LINE WITH THE SCIENCE BASED TARGETS INITIATIVE (SBTI), A PARTNERSHIP BETWEEN CDP,\xa0THE UN GLOBAL COMPACT, WORLD RESOURCES INSTITUTE (WRI) AND THE WORLD WIDE FUND FOR NATURE (WWF).'}